msgid "Behavior changes"
msgstr "做出更改"

msgid ""
"AnimationNodeBlendSpace1D and AnimationNodeBlendSpace2D have a new SyncMode "
"enum that replaces the previous boolean ``sync`` property. If you are using "
"an AnimationTree and your animations aren't transitioning correctly after "
"upgrading, you may need to set that value in each of your blend spaces to "
"get the desired behavior back."
msgstr ""
"AnimationNodeBlendSpace1D 和 AnimationNodeBlendSpace2D 現引入了新的 SyncMode "
"列舉型別，用以替代原有的 boolean ``sync`` 屬性。若您在升級後發現使用 "
"AnimationTree 時動畫過渡效果異常，可能需要在每個混合空間中手動設定該值，以恢"
"復預期的動畫行為。"

msgid ""
"The new sync modes are documented "
"in :ref:`AnimationNodeBlendSpace1D.sync_mode "
"<class_AnimationNodeBlendSpace1D_property_sync_mode>` "
"and :ref:`AnimationNodeBlendSpace2D.sync_mode "
"<class_AnimationNodeBlendSpace2D_property_sync_mode>`."
msgstr ""
"新的同步模式詳見 :ref:`AnimationNodeBlendSpace1D. sync_mode "
"<class_AnimationNodeBlendSpace1D_property_sync_mode>` "
"與 :ref:`AnimationNodeBlendSpace2D. sync_mode "
"<class_AnimationNodeBlendSpace2D_property_sync_mode>`。"

msgid ""
"The ``LinearToSRGB`` visual shader no longer clamps to the range ``[0.0, "
"1.0]`` when using the Mobile or Forward+ renderer (`GH-113956`_)."
msgstr ""
"當使用 Mobile 或 Forward+ 渲染器（ `GH-113956`_ ）時， ``LinearToSRGB`` 視覺"
"著色器不再被限制在 ``[0.0,1.0]`` 範圍內。"

msgid ""
"``CanvasItem`` now avoids adding the antialiasing feather when drawing lines "
"(`GH-105122`_). The feather made lines appear thicker than intended, "
"projects that relied on this behavior will have to be updated to draw a "
"thicker line width."
msgstr ""
"``CanvasItem`` 現在在繪製直線（`GH-105122`_）時不再新增反鋸齒羽化效果。由於該"
"羽化效果會使直線看起來比實際設計的更粗，因此相依性此行為的專案需進行相應更"
"新，以繪製出更粗的線寬。"

msgid ""
"The default ``area_mask`` for ``AudioStreamPlayer`` was changed from ``1`` "
"to ``0`` (disabled) (`GH-107679`_). If you use the ``audio_bus_override`` "
"feature on ``Area2D`` or ``Area3D``, **and** you use the "
"``AudioStreamPlayer`` default ``area_mask`` (just layer ``1`` ticked), you "
"will need to reset the mask to layer ``1`` — otherwise, the bus overrides "
"will stop working. If the mask was set to anything except layer ``1``, it "
"will continue to work as expected."
msgstr ""
"``AudioStreamPlayer`` 的預設 ``area_mask`` 已從 ``1`` 更改為 ``0`` （停用）"
"（參見 `GH-107679`_ ）。若您在 ``Area2D`` 或 ``Area3D`` 上使用了 "
"``audio_bus_override`` 功能， **且** 同時啟用了 ``AudioStreamPlayer`` 的預設 "
"``area_mask`` （僅勾選第 ``1`` 層），則需將遮罩重設為第 ``1`` 層——否則，總線"
"覆蓋功能將無法正常工作。若遮罩設定為除第 ``1`` 層以外的其他層，則該功能仍可按"
"預期執行。"

msgid ""
"When using Jolt Physics as the 3D physics engine, ``WorldBoundaryShape3D`` "
"will now use the same convention as Godot when applying "
"``WorldBoundaryShape3D.plane.d``, resulting in the sign of the plane "
"distance being interpreted in the opposite way compared to Godot 4.6 "
"(`GH-118948`_). You will need to flip the sign yourself to get the same "
"behavior as in Godot 4.6."
msgstr ""
"當使用 Jolt Physics 作為 3D 物理引擎時， ``WorldBoundaryShape3D`` 現在在應用 "
"``WorldBoundaryShape3D. plane.d`` 時將採用與 Godot 相同的約定，這導致平面距離"
"的符號含義與 Godot 4.6（`GH-118948`_）中的處理方式相反。您需要自行翻轉該符"
"號，才能獲得與 Godot 4.6 相同的行為效果。"

msgid ""
"When using Jolt Physics as the 3D physics engine, ``SoftBody3D`` will no "
"longer default its mass to ``0``, which resulted in an automatically "
"calculated weight of 1 kg per point, resulting in a very high total mass for "
"the body. Now instead it will default to 1 kg for the entire ``SoftBody3D``, "
"same as Godot Physics (`GH-116041`_)."
msgstr ""
"當使用 Jolt Physics 作為 3D 物理引擎時， ``SoftBody3D`` 不再將質量預設設"
"為“0”；此前這一設定會導致每個點的自動計算重量為 1 kg，從而使物體的總質量變得"
"非常大。現在， ``SoftBody3D`` 將預設為整個 ``SoftBody3D`` 的質量為 1 kg，這"
"與 Godot Physics ( `GH-116041`_ ) 的設定一致。"

msgid ""
"When using Jolt Physics as the 3D physics engine, ``SoftBody3D`` will now "
"apply ``SoftBody3D.linear_stiffness`` in a way that better matches Godot "
"Physics, and in a way that's more appropriate in general (`GH-116041`_). "
"This will affect every ``SoftBody3D`` instance in one way or another, "
"meaning you will need to re-tweak properties like "
"``SoftBody3D.linear_stiffness`` and ``SoftBody3D.damping_coefficient`` to "
"achieve your desired behavior."
msgstr ""
"當使用 Jolt Physics 作為 3D 物理引擎時， ``SoftBody3D`` 現將 ``SoftBody3D. "
"linear_stiffness`` 的應用方式調整為更符合 Godot Physics 的設計，並使其在總體"
"上更為恰當（參見 `GH-116041`_ ）。這一變化將以某種方式影響到所有 "
"``SoftBody3D`` 實例，因此您需要重新微調諸如 ``SoftBody3D. linear_stiffness`` "
"和 ``SoftBody3D. damping_coefficient`` 等屬性，以實現預期的物理行為。"

msgid ""
"When using Jolt Physics as the 3D physics engine, ``Area3D`` will now report "
"overlaps with ``SoftBody3D`` from its various signals and methods "
"(`GH-114198`_). To work around this breaking change, configure your "
"collision layers/masks such that any undesirable interactions between "
"``Area3D`` and ``SoftBody3D`` are ignored."
msgstr ""
"當使用 Jolt Physics 作為 3D 物理引擎時， ``Area3D`` 現將通過其各類訊號與方法"
"（如 `GH-114198`_ ）報告與 ``SoftBody3D`` 之間的重疊情況。為適應該項破壞性變"
"更，請設定您的碰撞層/遮罩，使 ``Area3D`` 與 ``SoftBody3D`` 之間任何不希望發生"
"的互動作用均被忽略。"

msgid "Input"
msgstr "輸入"

msgid ""
"The device IDs for mouse and keyboard were changed from ``0`` to "
"``InputEvent.DEVICE_ID_MOUSE`` and ``InputEvent.DEVICE_ID_KEYBOARD`` because "
"some joypads may use ``0`` as their ID (`GH-116274`_). Check the input event "
"by type or compare the device ID ``InputEvent.device`` to the constants "
"``InputEvent.DEVICE_ID_MOUSE`` and ``InputEvent.DEVICE_ID_KEYBOARD`` instead."
msgstr ""
"滑鼠和鍵盤的裝置 ID 已從 ``0`` 更改為 ``InputEvent. DEVICE_ID_MOUSE`` 和 "
"``InputEvent. DEVICE_ID_KEYBOARD`` ，因為部分遊戲控制器可能將 ``0`` 作為其裝"
"置 ID 使用（參見 `GH-116274`_ ）。請根據輸入事件型別進行檢查，或將裝置 ID "
"``InputEvent.device`` 與常數 ``InputEvent. DEVICE_ID_MOUSE`` 和 "
"``InputEvent. DEVICE_ID_KEYBOARD`` 進行比對。"

msgid "GDScript"
msgstr "GDScript"

msgid ""
"Setting the element of packed arrays no longer calls the setter for the "
"entire packed array property (`GH-113228`_)."
msgstr ""
"設定打包陣列中的單個元素時，不再呼叫整個打包陣列屬性（ `GH-113228`_ ）的 "
"setter 方法。"

msgid ""
"Methods that inherit from a method with a typed return now inherit the "
"return type as well, requiring an explicit return statement in the override "
"(`GH-115763`_). Add ``return null`` to the end of the method to fix the "
"error."
msgstr ""
"從具有型別化回傳值的方法繼承的方法，現在也會繼承該回傳型別，因此在覆寫方法"
"（ `GH-115763`_ ）中需新增顯式回傳語句。請將 ` ``return null`` ` 新增到該方法"
"末尾以修復此錯誤。"

msgid "Platforms"
msgstr "支援平台"

msgid ""
"The minimum macOS version required to run Godot was increased from macOS "
"10.13 (High Sierra) to macOS 11 (Big Sur)."
msgstr ""
"執行 Godot 所需的最低 macOS 版本已從 macOS 10.13（High Sierra）提升至 macOS "
"11（Big Sur）。"

msgid "Changed defaults"
